contentText:
Cardi B and Megan Thee Stallion’s “WAP” became certified diamond by the Recording Industry Association of America on Monday (Aug. 3).&nbsp;

Both Cardi and Meg posted on X shortly after hearing the pleasant news about having another plaque on the way to celebrate their latest accolades.&nbsp;

